   "lines": [
    {
     "id": "p1",
     "text": "When the agent needs permission, a card appears, and the session moves to Needs you."
    },
    {
     "id": "p3",
     "text": "Approve Once allows just this command. Deny refuses it."
    },
    {
     "id": "p4",
     "text": "Allow Similar covers every git command; Always Exact, only this one."
    },
    {
     "id": "p5",
     "text": "Would rather not be asked? YOLO Mode, under Permissions, switches the prompts off for this session. More on that in episode six.",
